notes: JCM 903 Vitamin mixture, the stock used by TOGO M944 / CultureMech:010367.
  Eight vitamins plus water; source explicitly says DL-calcium pantothenate. Distinct
  from JCM 1023 and existing generic Wolfe/Thauer formulas. Filter sterilize this
  stock before adding it to the cooled receiving medium.  Raw source labels remain
  source-scoped in the decisions; no generic label is published as a global synonym.
  Quantified components use the literal preparation batch unless explicitly marked
  MG_PER_L. Component names retain source specificity without inferred vitamer, hydrate
  or stereoisomer IDs. Occurrence counts remain zero pending source-specific integration.
  No roles or downstream hold release is proposed.
